	"data": "Concept: Weekly Retrospective\n\nWhat It Is\nA Monday morning automated review. Pulls git activity, journal mood/energy, and task completion data and surfaces 3 questions for cithoreal.\n\nSchedule\nEvery Monday at 9:00 AM — calcifer-retrospective.timer (systemd)\n\nScript\n~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/weekly_retrospective.py\n\nFormat\nGit activity summary (what got committed this week)\nJournal mood/energy trend (from audio pipeline data)\nTask completion rate\n3 questions for cithoreal to answer\n\nThe Q2…",
